  <h2 id="methodology">How we verify</h2>
  <p>Each operator's terms and sweepstakes rules are fetched directly, or via a US-located scrape when the operator blocks our region. Fields we cannot confirm from a public document are marked <em>unverified</em> — never filled in from assumption. Verification access dates are recorded in the dataset and updated on re-check.</p>

